// Native movies (FMV): native/wotm_fmv.hpp from the WoTM repo, turned on with PS2X_FMV=1 (wotmFmvInstall, called from main.cpp).
// Replaces CMovie::Play/Update/End and playMpegMovieWithDB/updateMpegMovieDecoding (the game's decoder waits on the IPU, which the
// runtime doesn't emulate) and plays the disc's .PSS (the cdRoot folder or the PS2X_CD_IMAGE ISO) with FFmpeg. Without the header or
// FFmpeg, PS2X_FMV only prints a warning.
